            {
                "comment": "Very clear and easy to understand during class.  She is organized and covers the material well.  Grades on compositions and tests are tough, but that is probably going to occur in any 226 class.  Chances are you won't know your TA until after all the sections are filled, so if you got her you are in good shape.",
